    *Table has Two columns (Player selection - Payout)


    10 placed
    on a Straight card game will get - 100


    10 placed on a Street cards game
    (Jack, Queen, King) will get - 25


    10 placed on a Suit cards game (Hearts,
    Spades, Diamonds and Clubs) will get - 33'
